<title>UK: SQUASH-SUPER SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-SUPER SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HATFIELD, England 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of third qualifying round matches in the Super Series squash Finals on Friday:</p>
<p>Fleet Group</p>
<p>Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Peter Nicol (Scotland) 9-6 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Zubair Jahan (Pakistan) 9-4 9-3 10-8</p>
<p>Harrow Group</p>
<p>Brett Martin (Australia) beat Simon Parke (England) 10-8 7-9</p>
<p>9-3 6-9 9-1</p>
<p>Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Mark Chaloner (England) 5-9 10-8 9-5 9-6</p>
<p>Final on Saturday: Jansher Khan v Brett Martin.</p>
</text>
